			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Flatten Decorations module structure\n\nRemove the intermediate re-export pattern in `Decorations/mod.rs` and retain only the module declaration for `DecorationsState`. This aligns with the ongoing decomposition of `FeatureState` into file-per-struct PascalCase modules, ensuring the `DecorationsState` struct resides in its own canonical path (`Decorations/DecorationsState.rs`).\n\nAdd `#![allow(non_snake_case)]` and clarify documentation to reflect the updated symbol resolution path `Decorations::DecorationsState::{DecorationData, DecorationsState}`, consistent with recent flattening of `LifecyclePhase`, `ScannedExtensions`, and `ExtensionRegistry`.",
